  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Op&#xe9;rations du HCR en Afrique australe (2024)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR operations in Southern Africa (2024)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Cette activit&#xe9; montre les d&#xe9;tails des op&#xe9;rations du HCR &#xe0; l&apos;Afrique australe pour 2024 et les ann&#xe9;es &#xe0; venir, y compris les financements affect&#xe9;s au niveau r&#xe9;gional.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity shows details of the UNHCR operations in Southern Africa for 2024 and future years including softly earmarked contributions.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR&apos;s work is made possible by the generosity of its donors, including dozens of governments, hundreds of companies and their employees, and millions of private individuals who give directly or through UNHCR&apos;s National Partners.

The activities of the UNHCR operations in Southern Africa are governed by the Financial Rules for Voluntary Funds Administered by the High Commissioner for Refugees.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Le HCR, l&apos;Agence des Nations Unies pour les r&#xe9;fugi&#xe9;s, est une organisation internationale qui a pour mission de sauver des vies, de prot&#xe9;ger les droits des r&#xe9;fugi&#xe9;s et de construire un avenir meilleur pour les r&#xe9;fugi&#xe9;s, les communaut&#xe9;s d&#xe9;plac&#xe9;es et les apatrides.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR, the UN Refugee Agency, is a global organisation dedicated to saving lives, protecting rights and building a better future for refugees, forcibly displaced communities and stateless people.</narrative>
  </description>
